WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Separate projects by client or app
Open saved reviews in My projects. Creating projects and saving new work require active Pro or the 14-day trial.

2
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Check the current project
Check the project name before uploading. Switching projects loads that project’s files, settings and records.

3
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Back up before moving devices
Export a backup file. Projects are stored in this browser and do not automatically sync between devices.

4
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Check the restore destination
Select a backup, inspect its contents and restore. Restoring requires active Pro. Back up before replacing a current project.
